Akamai Connected Cloud NemoClaw Quick Deploy App
Dashboard Access: SSH tunnel required (not publicly exposed)
Credentials File: /home/{{ username }}/.credentials
Documentation: https://www.linode.com/docs/marketplace-docs/guides/nemoclaw/
*********************************************************

NemoClaw's onboarding wizard runs automatically the first time you log in as
root (or via `sudo su -` as {{ username }}). It will ask which inference
provider to use and issue the dashboard's device-auth token.

Dashboard access steps (from your local machine):
	ssh -L 18789:127.0.0.1:18789 {{ username }}@{{ _domain }}
	Open: http://127.0.0.1:18789

Note: `nemoclaw <sandbox-name> dashboard-url` may show a host URL, but this
deployment expects SSH tunneling for browser access.

To delete this message of the day: rm /etc/motd
